OL,3,GNEWSALaw Society CEO found 'guilty of
OL,4,Agross misconduct' over character
OL,5,Areference
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Law Society chief executive has
OL,8,Fbeen found "guilty of gross misconduct"
OL,9,Ffollowing a character reference he
OL,10,Fprovided to a cousin convicted of
OL,11,Fserious sexual offences.
OL,13,FDavid Lavery had provided a character
OL,14,Freference to a court after the
OL,15,Fconviction of former schoolteacher
OL,16,FWilliam Lloyd-Lavery.
OL,18,FThe Law Society said an independent
OL,19,Fdisciplinary panel "determined that the
OL,20,Fappropriate sanction that the Chief
OL,21,FExecutive received a sanction short of
OL,22,Fdismissal".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
